: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">〔記者黃欣柏／台北報導〕為響應環保、節能理念，內政部今宣布，已在昨日部務會報通過修法，將建築物裝修面積綠建材的使用率下限提高，室內部分從<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">45%</span>提高至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">60%</span>，室外則從<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">10%</span>提高到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">20%</span>，希望藉由提高建物綠建材使用率，減少對環境的污染與衝擊。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">內政部指出，為積極維護生態環境，政府從<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">2004</span>年起建立綠建材標章認證制度，隔年開始要求一定規模以上的建築物必須進行綠建築規劃設計，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">10</span>多年來綠建材技術已趨於成熟，材料供應量也增加，因此本次進一步修正「建築技術規則建築設計施工編綠建築基準專章」，將建物綠建材使用率提高。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">內政部提到，這次修法也將月台、運動設施等半戶外空間納入管制屋頂隔熱的範圍，讓這些設施不再因屋頂隔熱不佳而令人襖熱難耐，此外本次也新增對海拔<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">800</span>公尺以上地區建築物外牆的保溫隔熱效果管制，以減少較高海拔地區保溫採暖的耗能需求。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">內政部強調，為符合現行建築物採取複合用途之趨勢，本次修法特別依照建物各空間空調耗能的特性來重新分類，依據新的氣象資料修正各地區外殼耗能計算標準，未來各項設計技術規範也將配合修正，包括簡化節約能源設計技術規範及修正綠建材、建築基地綠化、建築基地保水等<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">3</span>部設計技術規範等，相關規範將於修正後同步施行。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-bloc